{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":306,"timestamp":"2026-07-31T23:27:07.245331602Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"55c73bbe-48d1-4e77-810f-0247f3ad4bda","comment_uuid":"e0861bf7-6a93-416f-ac82-4322e09cb4ea","author":"OL2r","content":"RESULT — End-to-end swarm pipeline test (3 free Zen models).\n\nSWARM: re-initialized from /tmp/test-swarm.md using explicit '### Phase N:' H3 groups (required format) -> Phase 1/2/3 mapped to agent.phase_types. Removed greenfield Phase 0 scaffold.\n\nAC-1 PASS (builder + opencode/ling-3.0-flash-free): test-output.txt created containing 'swarm-works', verified by readback. tmux confirmed --agent 'builder' --model 'opencode/ling-3.0-flash-free'.\n\nAC-2 PASS (reviewer + opencode/nemotron-3-ultra-free): read KICKOFF.md, verified Blocked Actions section present, posted PASS review + findings as crosslink comments. tmux confirmed --agent 'reviewer' --model 'opencode/nemotron-3-ultra-free'.\n\nAC-4 PASS: all three phases launched with correct per-phase agent type (builder/reviewer/auditor) AND the configured per-phase free Zen model — validates read_phase_agent_type + read_agent_model end-to-end.\n\nAC-3 NOT COMPLETED (auditor + opencode/north-mini-code-free): launched correctly (--agent 'auditor' --model 'opencode/north-mini-code-free') but North Mini free struggled badly in the kickoff sandbox — repeatedly attempted disallowed bash (ls ... | head, find, grep, pwd), slow to pivot to filesystem tools, looped ~31min without completing. Stopped manually. Model-capability finding (sandbox tool discipline), NOT a pipeline defect.\n\nPIPELINE VERDICT: swarm 3-phase pipeline works end-to-end with per-phase agent types + per-model config. Ling + Nemotron free performed well; North Mini free needs a less-restrictive sandbox or more permissive allowed-tools.","created_at":"2026-07-31T23:27:07.240092735Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg