{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":323,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T00:34:41.035681918Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"55c73bbe-48d1-4e77-810f-0247f3ad4bda","comment_uuid":"a1adb347-0001-4e33-bc99-8325d35ed515","author":"OL2r","content":"PLAN — work through the 9 sub-issues (#109-#118). Deps ordered.\n\nWAVE 0 (no deps, housekeeping):\n- #110 formalize corrected root-cause record as resolution\n- #113 bulk-close stale test issues (--no-changelog)\n- #112 release 8 stale OL2r locks + enable auto_steal_stale_locks\n- #111 add blocked_by edges #106->#107->#108\n\nWAVE 1 (root cause / critical path):\n- #109 sandbox permission enforcement: trace denial origin (build_allowed_tools vs opencode permission matcher / crosslink-guard.ts plugin); align configs; verify one read-only agent can run git status / ls\n\nWAVE 2 (doc/template consistency):\n- #116 crosslink intervene -> crosslink issue intervene (KICKOFF.md, rules/global.md, builder.md, crosslink-guard.ts)\n- #115 retry handoff: KICKOFF.md instructs noting prior attempts + failure cause\n- #117 KICKOFF.md final steps require result comment\n- #114 resolve findings/ dangling links (merge #73/#74 docs or trim refs)\n\nWAVE 3 (validation):\n- #118 re-run full 3-phase after #109+#111, exercising artifact handoff + dependency enforcement; only then close #78.\n\nRATIONALE: Wave 0 clears noise so real failures surface; Wave 1 fixes the thing blocking all agents; Wave 2 stops docs re-triggering confusion; Wave 3 is the honest gate.","created_at":"2026-08-01T00:34:41.029614509Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA5Yh6NED1VumaTCySOJdwMGphtYyvayCJRi/OwnSE0jO81GkYE/H6EcB0dppzT4nkQYOHAefokfHODte2nF0MBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAAL