{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":324,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T00:44:58.062902140Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"55c73bbe-48d1-4e77-810f-0247f3ad4bda","comment_uuid":"9002a6ec-cf8b-4645-935f-e0df5598cc6c","author":"OL2r","content":"PLAN REVISION v2 — incorporates Big Pickle adversarial review (observations #79/#80/#81). Verdict: direction approved, CHANGES REQUESTED.\n\nREVISED WAVES:\n\nWAVE 0 (housekeeping, re-sequenced):\n- #112 stale locks FIRST (8 test issues OL2r-locked; verify close-on-locked behavior, then release + enable auto_steal — but first verify staleness heuristic against active sessions since heartbeat hooks are missing)\n- #113 bulk-close stale test issues WITH explicit exclusions: keep #73/#74 (unmerged findings, #114 dependency), #106-#118, real work (#14-#21, #22-#27). --no-changelog.\n- #110 formalize corrected root-cause record\n- #111 blocked_by edges #106->#107->#108 AND encode wave ordering: #118 blocked by #109/#111/#115/#116/#117 so 'ready' can't start Wave 3 early\n- Fix priorities: #109/#110/#111/#112/#118 -> high (descriptions say High but tracker says medium)\n\nWAVE 1 (root cause + enforcement — EXPANDED):\n- #109 sandbox enforcement. NEW: must resolve align-vs-deny BEFORE Wave 2. NEW: security pairing required — today blanket bash deny is the ONLY git-write blocker; if we make matcher honor 'git *', read-only agents gain git push with no enforcement layer (crosslink-guard.ts unloaded, hooks undeployed). Fix must either (a) load plugin + deploy hooks alongside, or (b) deny-bash + rewrite KICKOFF.md 'Always allowed' + git-based review section. Verification criterion: 'git push remains blocked for reviewer/auditor'. Trace all 4 layers (plugin-not-loaded, hooks-missing, opencode matcher, launcher --allowedTools). Cheap discriminator first: minimal frontmatter (like builder.md) vs map form. NOTE: hook-config allowed_bash_prefixes omits cat/grep/find (they're only in plugin DEFAULT_ALLOWED_BASH which hook-config replaces) — reconcile all 3 sources.\n\nWAVE 2 (doc/template — blocked on #109 direction):\n- #116 EXPANDED: also fix invalid 'crosslink comment' form (KICKOFF.md step 4, rules/global.md l.130/196, tracking-normal.md l.60) plus 'crosslink intervene'\n- #115 retry handoff\n- #117 result-comment requirement\n- #114 findings links; MUST merge #73/#74 before #113 closes them\n\nWAVE 3 (final gate — RE-SPECIFIED):\n- #118: (1) define artifact handoff mechanism (/tmp shared path OR git-fetch handoff; note git fetch not in allowed lists today -> needs #109 fix), (2) prove DOWNSTREAM CONSUMPTION (reviewer asserts artifact content, not self-contained check), (3) explicit PASS criteria: AC-1..4 + handoff + dependency edges verified (treat as process-only, not machine-enforced — no evidence swarm blocks at launch) + plan+result comments per #117 + auditor completes, (4) pin models (ling/nemotron builder/reviewer, big-pickle auditor) + max-runtime, (5) FRESH phase issues (not #106-#108) with artifact path + deps + #78 link baked in.\n\nFOLDED IN: 'hooks not deployed' goes into #109 (enforcement) and #112 (staleness misdetection).","created_at":"2026-08-01T00:44:58.056659120Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAUkaumMiRwL7zjEwePKDKI2a1Zp+os84/wj/5KoRACQaM//aLrVgoLW8HGkczdLCwHo/ynM0FShryssm6OzhmCg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHsbDMoIqdufMZ2uiH63GKLLAzdULAhA7Sn8sxi4mjDJg5aOEF5YlCulzKjlMZx/kiCl/0tulrvspi2g/QGvgw4="}
