{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":420,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T01:18:08.725853124Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"9dc62041-4dc2-4042-ac5d-724e6a2af5b4","title":"Fix DB rehydration wipe during sync-fetch","description":"Operational defect observed repeatedly this session: sync.fetch() rehydrates the SQLite DB from a stale hub state, dropping local-only issues/comments. Hit during swarm reset, kickoff stop, and multiple comment posts (#78/#113 'not found' needing crosslink compact recovery each time). Cost: added ~minutes of wall-clock to Wave 0 execution and loses in-flight records. Root cause family overlaps #109 (hub/remote state consistency). Address in Wave 1 alongside #109.","priority":"medium","parent_uuid":"55c73bbe-48d1-4e77-810f-0247f3ad4bda","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL/cjBBcJPrBmgWbmsJX+c8ama8qZAhJCrgJdBbY+RwYMl87mZprYJ8+vtH5lXS02y9KnvJsms/ik00f9EXXjAM="}
