{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":425,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T02:39:29.385731213Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"87738dd2-98f2-495f-840b-2b7219d5d26e","comment_uuid":"6e57237e-b3f5-457f-b57c-a13d02158a56","author":"OL2r","content":"RESOLVED — 5th round verification PASS (5/5).\n\nRoot causes found and fixed:\n1. .opencode/opencode.json missing plugin array -> crosslink-guard never loaded (4ea37be: load plugin + agent defs)\n2. rtk-guard mutated commands -> built-in matcher evaluated mutated form (37c5fb1: add rtk * allow to frontmatter)\n3. agent_overrides replaced blocked/gated lists with narrower ones -> git push + git commit unblocked (0af5240: full blocked list + gated commit in agent_overrides)\n4. No per-agent-type distinction -> reviewers could commit same as builders (4f15a63: by_type.reviewer/auditor blocks git commit)\n5. Worktree hook-config stale -> guard read wrong agent type (7f77cfd + claude wrapper: CROSSLINK_AGENT_TYPE env var)\n\nVERIFIED: reviewer agent: git status/log/ls SUCCEED, git push BLOCKED (guard), git commit BLOCKED (by_type override). Guard log confirms 'by_type override applied for agent: reviewer' (71 occurrences) + BLOCK entries for push and commit. No test commit created.\n\nCONFIG RESTORED: sentinel.default_agent.model -> opencode-go/deepseek-v4-pro, agent.type -> builder. Note: the claude wrapper at ~/.local/bin/claude now exports CROSSLINK_AGENT_TYPE as the authoritative per-call agent-type signal. Backup saved at /tmp/opencode/claude-wrapper.bak.","created_at":"2026-08-01T02:39:29.378194827Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAZiQPj6+Um0F/eG6sYoetvjZ/FntL7E2p+Gr/SB7kby/FAOTzsmj7xlY+QYb7z3+Cs8D4jvf67OY0imZaqyq8Cg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0