{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":435,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T17:56:08.813120245Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"9dc62041-4dc2-4042-ac5d-724e6a2af5b4","comment_uuid":"7ed494e3-8584-4448-85b1-6593a0f5c494","author":"OL2r","content":"RESOLVED — code fix landed in the crosslink fork (crosslink/src/hydration.rs). hydrate_from_state now preserves SQLite-only issues regardless of created_by, and honors the deleted_issues tombstone set so deliberately deleted issues are never resurrected. Root cause recap: the created_by IS NULL filter was a legacy guard (distinguishing direct-SQLite rows from deleted SharedWriter ones) that became a data-loss trap once create_issue_with_author started writing created_by for all new issues. Regression test added (test_hydrate_preserves_fork_authored_sqlite_only_issue) covering both preserved-fork-authored and dropped-tombstoned cases; 39 hydration + 48 shared_writer + 86 compaction tests green. The #794 tracker_remote=fork fix remains the operational mitigation; this closes the latent code-level trap.","created_at":"2026-08-01T17:56:08.801281243Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA3KNlQJqFDWFHviApewC+uug1q/MugKXog7ORLvgk5CRPr61kQ9bA1LRa8EASwl8slYJCBwSW91PuapHdq93GDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG+xlq1zu/zcGqvqh1q0unSTL1KirGKEMItZVlIce/Bc2wt8fanu3n9TzlJx92UU3xfAUrILqzOIRW3NI3O+0gA="}
