{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":525,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:08:55.285385542Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"3b8274f4-d06e-415a-b1a8-aaab3bdf6237","comment_uuid":"212d3ed8-6afe-4e4d-8eaa-253e9ea9e8c7","author":"OL2r","content":"OPERATIONAL RULE (2026-08-03, confirmed via live tripn-astro incident): HUB AGENT REFS ARE GROUND TRUTH for agent output, NOT the local main-repo SQLite DB. Agent events.log on refs/heads/crosslink/agents/<id> contains CommentAdded events (reviews, results) — readable via git show/log WITHOUT any sync. NEVER run 'crosslink sync' in the main repo to 'refresh' visibility: that is the exact command that caused the June rollback (#338/#342/#370-376) and the repeated 'not found' drops this session. Rules: (1) to verify agent output, read the hub agent refs; (2) to recover visibility, re-hydrate safely (or compact) — never blind sync; (3) liveness and data-visibility are separate failures (see #135 Phase 1.5). This must be codified into agent-orchestration-playbook.md verification guidance (§6.2) and crosslink-guide knowledge.","created_at":"2026-08-03T05:08:55.278942610Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA/FXEuEf7n5w0+KQDETt5lP7Lw6M4BbbJb/VFFFrzcwgCvEIUJpc5ASIOnetLHrtqlq88l8sKzSZCqZetul0dAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMr5DnWYAnIgy4v0El5F8Oc/72QUXBgX0FgWDIvax/xfuJeP2OURhKRXFnXOjvEIbknHAah06KxNvidkk9onyAM="}
{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":526,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:19:48.989656670Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"52f44369-b47d-40e1-91c5-4a95fe9f7d30","title":"FORK BUG: kickoff watchdog nudge never fires — exit-condition bug in launch.rs. Evidence: launch.rs:646-649 writes .kickoff-status (LAUNCHING) BEFORE spawning the watchdog (launch.rs:667-671); watchdog script's first check is 'if [ -f {worktree}/.kickoff-status ]; then exit 0; fi' (launch.rs:100). Since the status file ALWAYS exists by watchdog start, the watchdog exits immediately at first check — the heartbeat-staleness nudge logic is dead code. Nothing ever deletes the status file (RUNNING written at launch.rs:665), so the exit condition stays permanently true. FIX: change exit condition to check for a TERMINAL sentinel (DONE/FAILED/CI_FAILED content) rather than mere file existence, or check for an explicit 'watchdog-disarm' marker on completion. This is fork-side code (/home/claude-code/projects/crosslink) — fix + rebuild per crosslink-fork.md build instructions. PREREQUISITE for #135 Phase 2. Evidence originally from big-pickle review #137.","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEzFUplDbDVBsOoYWTDUH0sbSN2IpYhKkxH0lSIzqNGreEQvBdrR9V6W/I0883kSqGdCJAqPjM6GzNXClgtfUA8="}
