{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":535,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:20:55.358331997Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"246c7e5b-4bb4-404f-bfd3-d9eee60e0e3f","comment_uuid":"aef2b042-6b65-459f-b979-c6514a0e9b81","author":"OL2r","content":"ADD TO PHASE 1 DOCS DELIVERABLE (2026-08-03) — two session-learned operational rules to codify in agent-orchestration-playbook.md alongside the Phase 1 watcher section: (1) HUB-REFS GROUND-TRUTH RULE: hub agent refs (refs/heads/crosslink/agents/<id>/events.log) are ground truth for agent output, NOT the local main-repo SQLite DB; never run 'crosslink sync' in the main repo to refresh visibility (it caused the June rollback). See #125 OPERATIONAL RULE comment. (2) STANDING WORKFLOW RULES: (a) while any kickoff/swarm agent runs, EVERY orchestrator turn ends with a brief Agent Status note (state, time-in, last signal) even if nothing changed; (b) run crosslink kickoff cleanup after each dispatch wave (assess STALE with --dry-run --force, preserve work before removing). Codify both in the playbook verification/monitoring section (§6.2) and the workflow/status section. Mirror to tripn-astro per §5.5 two-repo sync.","created_at":"2026-08-03T05:20:55.352400750Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAOlQzPApgvi5VIR0VXj5CW+3h3smgTO0gV2/jeJiz5ndp/Lib6zbg/PS7wuqOi3ftvL+RVPRkndl3uBxjoA9sBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFZGt8NE9pN3v2H2t288jwwYgGgmvJQrN6Ncozg2TdXHkeOtr+76fnh4lwKLE6bEt4zHIkl40cgRFPl0kfI76w4="}
{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":536,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:26:52.105310222Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"6de93a06-d6a0-48c4-902d-6c23bdda5f98","title":"MIGRATION: rebuild the #135 watcher in Rust inside the crosslink fork (Python version is temporary). DECISION (2026-08-03, operator): keep tools/kickoff-notify.py now for immediate monitoring value, but it is EXPLICITLY TEMPORARY — the durable home is crosslink (Rust), per #134 Path A. SCOPE: add a sentinel local source (sources/local.rs) to /home/claude-code/projects/crosslink that observes .worktrees/*/ — .kickoff-status, .kickoff-metadata.json, .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat — tracks LAUNCHING/RUNNING/DONE/FAILED/CI_FAILED + STALLED, emits Signal events into the existing sentinel poll loop (engine.rs poll_all_sources), and reuses the existing notify pipeline (notify.rs: notify_dispatch_completed / webhook). Mirror #135 Phase 1 watcher behavior: heartbeat-primary detection, 2-consecutive debounce, LAUNCHING grace, per-model floors, state persisted (sentinel state or a state file), idempotent. WHEN: after Phase 1 proven (Tier-1 experiment done) — do NOT build while Python watcher still unproven. SUCCESS: python tools/kickoff-notify.py can be deleted; crosslink 'sentinel watch' (or a new 'crosslink watch' command) provides monitor/notify natively. References #134 (Path A estimate ~150-300 LOC), #135 (watcher design), #138 (watchdog bug fix prerequisite for the nudge tier).","priority":"medium","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGdSIdY4Psica5iGNje8SbQ7LHdXTu0Gx6AiiWmyDp86PaxXzMbcqKYzqQAXkV+clIojGYoYb43k3oLcPILMBA4="}
