{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":539,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:38:17.089604957Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f07207cd-d69f-4856-93e4-7db9b3d7a922","comment_uuid":"538c041d-cfda-4d46-8067-c419e26adbe8","author":"OL2r","content":"SCOPE ADDITION (2026-08-03): document the OPENCODE REQUEST-TIMEOUT CONFIGURATION — currently only in the cb15188 commit message, not in any doc (both repos). Add a 'Request Timeout Configuration' subsection to model-discipline.md (and mirror to tripn-astro per §5.5): file = ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json (USER-LEVEL GLOBAL, not in-repo — call this out explicitly); schema = provider.<id>.options.{timeout,headerTimeout,chunkTimeout} (NOT provider.<id>.timeout — verified against opencode 1.18.11 schema); current values = timeout 3600000ms, headerTimeout 300000ms, chunkTimeout 300000ms for providers 'opencode' and 'opencode-go'; rationale = 5-min chunkTimeout exceeds worst-case legitimate inter-chunk gap for deepseek-v4-* reasoning while catching the observed 10+min silent-stream hangs, kept above the 120s heartbeat throttle to avoid false aborts. Distinguish from §5.3 task-matched timeout (agent runtime) — this is the per-API-request timeout.","created_at":"2026-08-03T05:38:17.073037304Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAQQGp0WWwCsfwwZ3aKDc0w7KA+H7njGO8bYLm3dUMHjM1D+l3IITVuUOxTDdMLERMgYxK2vaOAfziUT4yIZM9CA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM6Tsbl69rwfS4ptk/8gi4k3SRNNQ2gRYVjATujEWMPtlGc5SjlFuJKIIZAh4HmpwanWxpFjLEcY1+Sr81AF0AQ="}
