{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":567,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:19:06.681117919Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"96e2152d-85c5-465e-b90f-2d593b463473","title":"RESEARCH BEFORE FILING UPSTREAM: search for existing opencode issues/discussions about the wrapSSE content-type guard bypassing timeouts, and the silent-hang-on-non-SSE-response failure. Context: #144 verdict found packages/opencode/src/provider/provider.ts wrapSSE returns response UNWRAPPED when content-type lacks text/event-stream, so chunkTimeout is bypassed; non-SSE responses hang forever with zero errors and the agent looks RUNNING. Before we file a new upstream issue for #145 (patch wrapSSE), check: (1) existing opencode GitHub issues/PRs about chunkTimeout, wrapSSE, provider timeout not working, hangs on streaming responses; (2) discussions elsewhere (reddit r/opencode, opencode discord/talk, Hacker News, blog posts) about agents hanging on provider responses / timeouts not firing / silent retry loops; (3) any known workarounds or related fixes already proposed. DELIVERABLE: post ONE verdict on this issue listing found issues/discussions with URLs + brief relevance assessment, and whether our #145 finding appears novel or duplicates something already reported. Web research only — no code changes. Time-box ~25m.","priority":"medium","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQN1frggoABOC+4EkXhRgMUTeqkdwyyOsUnyNnb3IyxUcuYe7b5crajARMAKOahOzSof6emf5TAhGvD8gWEAB2w4="}
