{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":656,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T23:21:12.690256074Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"7d99a664-8ced-4785-b581-1eb199bc929b","title":"DEFERRED: manually import the V3 lock-protocol fix (main commit 31a3e2e8, Closes #790) into fork-local/agents. CONTEXT: cherry-pick of 31a3e2e8 from main onto fork-local/agents CONFLICTED in crosslink/src/shared_writer/locks.rs (predicted by #160 audit: main deletes clear_stale_lock_state/refactors force_release; fork adds GH#8 lazy refresh at the same is_v3() block). Conflict is a combine-both-intents case, not pick-one. DECISION: defer manual import — do NOT rush a risky manual resolve now. WHEN PICKED UP: (1) diff main's locks.rs/shared_writer changes vs fork-local's; (2) merge both intents (preserve the V3 force_release/steal fixes AND the GH#8 lazy refresh); (3) also check compaction.rs (was staged in the aborted cherry-pick); (4) run the lock test suite (crosslink locks release/steal); (5) verify with the #790 test scenario. Related: #160 (fork audit), #790 (upstream). Flash model. Low urgency — fork-local/agents works without it.","priority":"low","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLfl5TG52P8yczXhRUJvMLfs3Benjo1ka4wcqlrtnyZ6KKmiWVdFpQyLvwFvKU4/Wqd3nJCZTZ5udQBURtvxVgA="}
