{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":795,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T22:43:33.344149887Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"5e5970fc-f7ae-46fd-bd36-44501b5d5c35","title":"DESIGN REVISION SUB-ISSUE (#154 round 2): revise the durable opencode silent-hang fix design on #175 to address ALL reviewer blockers/findings (r1 hy3 #176: B1/B2/B3, F4-F13; r2 luna #177: 5 fixes; r3 big-pickle #178: R1/R2/R3). REVISE (post updated design as --kind result to THIS sub-issue, referencing the #175 baseline): (1) B1 — patch BOTH guard copies: packages/opencode/src/provider/provider.ts AND packages/core/src/aisdk.ts (v2 SessionRunner path), or prove with evidence that the v2 runner is unreachable in our launch mode (opencode run via claude wrapper) and record it as an explicit re-checkable assumption; note aiskd.ts raises plain Error not APIError and has no headerTimeout. (2) B2 — ADJUDICATE deadline shape: revise §3 from Option B (total-completion) to an IDLE-PROGRESS deadline for the non-SSE branch (Option A': distinct longer per-chunk idle deadline, e.g. bodyIdleTimeout=600000, resetting on each chunk, optionally + generous absolute cap slightly under the 1h request timeout); justify defaults numerically vs timeout=3600000 and retry budget so idle x attempts < request timeout < operator timeout; document the false-abort class Option B introduced (long streaming responses with non-SSE content-type: Bedrock eventstream, ndjson, text/plain). (3) B3 — REPLACE blanket RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS=3 with error-class-scoped budget: tight attempt cap for timeout/stream-class errors (ResponseStreamError, HeaderTimeoutError, ECONNRESET); preserve retry-after honoring for 429/usage-limit (retry.ts honours retry-after; upstream tests wait >10min; FreeUsageLimitError/GoUsageLimitError 'resets in 3 hours'); consider total-elapsed-retry-time budget. FIX the off-by-one (meta.attempt is 1-based retry count: constant=total attempts with >=, or RETRY_MAX_RETRIES=2 so <=3 POSTs). (4) F4 — per-attempt retry logging at the retry boundary (WARN/ERROR per attempt with attempt#, error code, next-delay) — zero-risk, fixes operator-blindness independent of the cap. (5) F5 — reconcile 1h AbortSignal.timeout vs #142's 10.9h zero-retry hang: add turn-level wall-clock guard above the parsed stream (llm.ts fullStream, upstream #39968) OR instrument real path (log content-type/transport/last-progress per parsed event); add real-provider capture to verification. (6) F6-F9 — wrapBody on pull() shape with sound timer/controller lifecycle (settled guard, clearTimeout in cancel, .catch on cancel promise); make bodyTimeout opt-in (or derived from chunkTimeout configured); fix POST-count invariant. (7) F10-F12 — atomic install (stage + same-fs mv, not cp); build prereqs (workspace-root bun install, bun@1.3.14 pin, --skip-embed-web-ui decision documented, postinstall fix-node-pty); fork-identity marker (OPENCODE_VERSION/CHANNEL defines at build.ts:192-199) + launch-time drift detection in ~/.local/bin/opencode or #146 watcher. (8) R1-R3 — retry-budget predicate pinned (above), test-6 slow-mode gaps MUST exceed chunkTimeout (5s gaps x 5 chunks, chunkTimeout=3000, bodyTimeout=30000), test-7 per-request-differentiating server mode or source-confirmed downgrade (provider.ts:1746 new AbortController per fetch closure). (9) Verification matrix additions: stalled-but-not-dead stream, gzip non-SSE body, non-chat requests, fork unit tests (retry.test.ts exists), grep-assert ERROR line, POST counts not attempt indices. OPERATOR ADJUDICATION on B2: direction = adopt idle-progress (Option A') unless the revision produces evidence the total-completion shape is required; keep the trade-off table with numbers. Post updated design + a change-log of what changed vs #175.","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MT