{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":834,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:30:44.472863432Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c212e3bd-e79a-41b0-bd0b-679d4b8c3b83","comment_uuid":"56881653-fbda-471f-b3f9-b48e57cbf998","author":"OL2r","content":"ROUND-2 RE-REVIEW SYNTHESIS (session #13/#14): revised design #180 re-reviewed by 3 models. r2 (mimo-v2.5-free #183) = PASS. r3 (big-pickle #184) = CONDITIONAL (2 impl-level: Stream.timeoutFail missing in effect 4.0.0-beta.83 -> use Stream.timeoutOrElse; test 9b underspecified). r1 (hy3 #182) = CONDITIONAL — 5 NEW blocking conditions V1-V5 (all impl-level, architecture accepted): V1 (B1) aisdk.ts hunk 4 references undeclared bodyIdleAbortCtl + positional signals.find mis-binds controllers -> Patch B does not compile; V2 (R2) §7.1 bodyIdleTimeout=30000 set behind timeout=15000 -> new deadline can NEVER fire, test 6's 25s slow body guaranteed false-abort at 15s, test 9 unrunnable; V3 (F7) bodyAbsoluteTimeout callback lacks stream controller (cannot close/error stream) + never clears absoluteId on idle path; V4 (B2) numeric chain compares chain-total to per-request timeout and FAILS the project's own 15-20m operator-timeout ladder (SESSION-START §4a) -> re-derive against 15-20m not 1h; V5 (B3/F4) terminal WARN reports meta.attempt+1 = 4 POSTs (contradicts 3-POST invariant) + sits on non-Effect Cause.done return. Plus 9 non-blocking (ZlibError in unbounded class, header passthrough undecided, no config-schema entry -> bodyIdleTimeout typos silently accepted, wrong F11 citation, F5 guard left optional, OPENCODE_CHANNEL/IS_PREVIEW interaction, drift-check spawn cost, TUI message mapping lost, no v2-patch matrix row). NET: design architecture ACCEPTED by all 3; remaining blockers are patch-code correctness (compile errors, parameter contradictions, timer lifecycle) — a final implementation-ready pass, not another architecture round. INCIDENT: r1's worktree crosslink DB was not hydrated (4 local rows only), so it ran all crosslink issue commands against the main checkout, and its final 'crosslink session end' ended ORCHESTRATOR session #13. No data lost; session #14 resumed, #156 re-claimed. HARNESS GAP (worth fixing): kickoff sub-agents asked to comment on hub issues have no safe way to do so from their own worktree if the worktree DB isn't hydrated.","created_at":"2026-08-05T23:30:44.463114110Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAMq8B3KuqudseyVqAjCUlKkM6C7LJz9mkwV6RLFjpDnRukW9R+iY3FBc9XRcmRup+qZz02+fJru/f7auezGO3DQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHwXH8b7dDT1juVIfKhPQOvlpXUGP+l1UaOHtIBOYidJo6TlkUNQc9dmIH+f0Ut9RIB6uX3QbFn2u6Fcs3gBvg0="}
{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":835,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:33:35.127334498Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"e8d793ca-3c95-474b-ae98-609ffcbe254b","title":"FINAL PATCH-CORRECTNESS REVISION (#154 round 3): make the #180 revised design IMPLEMENTATION-READY by fixing all round-2 reviewer blockers (r1 hy3 #182 V1-V5 + F-new-1..9; r3 big-pickle #184 F5-1/F5-2/B1-1/B3-1/F5-3). This is a DESIGN-DOC revision (executable patch code + test specs), NOT implementation. MUST FIX: V1 (B1) aisdk.ts Hunk 4 — declare bodyIdleAbortCtl and keep BOTH AbortControllers (signals.find returns only the first); provide final compilable Patch B code; V2 (R2) harness param contradiction — bodyIdleTimeout=30000 must EXCEED timeout=15000 (e.g. set timeout=60000) else the new deadline can never fire; re-verify test 6 (25s slow body) and test 9 runnable; V3 (F7) bodyAbsoluteTimeout callback must receive the stream controller (close/error the stream) and clear absoluteId on the idle path; V4 (B2) re-derive the numeric chain against the PROJECT's 15-20m operator-timeout ladder (SESSION-START §4a), not 1h — bodyIdleTimeout x attempts < operator timeout; V5 (B3/F4) terminal WARN must report meta.attempt (=3 POSTs, not meta.attempt+1) and be an Effect-aware log on the Cause.done path. F5-1: replace Stream.timeoutFail with Stream.timeoutOrElse({duration, orElse: () => Stream.fail(...)}) (verified in effect 4.0.0-beta.83). F5-2: pin test 9b — SSE comment keepalives (: ping) so raw cadence continues while parsed events stop + short llmIdleTimeout. ALSO address the 9 minor findings (ZlibError retry class, header passthrough, config-schema entry for bodyIdleTimeout to catch typos, F11 citation fix, F5 guard mandatory not optional, OPENCODE_CHANNEL/IS_PREVIEW, drift-check spawn cost, TUI message mapping, v2-patch matrix row) + aiskd.ts/aisdk.ts filename typo everywhere. DELIVERABLE: updated design + executable patch hunks + corrected test matrix + change-log vs #180, posted as --kind result to THIS