{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":870,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T00:38:37.400272219Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"07aca5b3-3aa3-44cd-b60b-8f16fdaa8efd","title":"FIX (crosslink fork, launch.rs): kickoff --timeout must NOT kill the process — timer is a guide, not a destroyer. EVIDENCE (2026-08-06 session #14): reviewer pp3g-gr9C (#188) was hard-killed at its 20m deadline while HEALTHY — it had posted [VERIFY] at 00:10, started the verdict stream 00:10:58, and the GNU timeout wrapper (launch.rs:235/239 'timeout {timeout_secs}s {claude_cmd}') killed it at 00:11:41 (43s into the stream, chunkTimeout never implicated). OPERATOR DIRECTION: 'I don't want the timer to kill the process, it's a guide to see how things are moving. The actual idea is milestones the orchestrator can check in on — a stream of evidence of work if things are happening, or silence for x amount of time leaves the agent presumed stalled and calls for a check.' CURRENT MECHANISMS (verified in fork source): (1) timeout wrapper = HARD KILL (wrong); (2) heartbeat watchdog (WatchdogConfig, launch.rs:87-139, default enabled, staleness 300s, max 5 nudges, check 120s, grace 300s) = inert (per #138 exit-condition bug) and only nudges via tmux send-keys, never reports. REQUIRED CHANGE: (a) timeout becomes non-destructive — remove the kill wrapper or make it a very generous backstop far above any task ceiling so it never fires in normal operation; (b) liveness = evidence stream: milestone checkpoints (already §5.4 mandatory) + .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat mtime + file/commit activity; (c) silence > 2x expected interval AND stale heartbeat = PRESUMED STALLED -> orchestrator investigates (ps, pane tail) -> only then #146-gated kill/relaunch. Never the timer doing it. DEPENDENCY: heartbeat hook must be installed in worktrees (#135 Phase 2 — currently worktrees do NOT carry .claude/hooks/heartbeat.py). COORDINATES with: #135 (watcher phases), #146 (Phase 3 kill/restart gates), #123 (timeout guidance). Implement in the crosslink fork at /home/claude-code/projects/crosslink (launch.rs + types.rs WatchdogConfig), verify with a live kickoff.","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQADb6ykv3nkxXS8tTJDyK1QMzNuWStNNh01YRcufjAYZjxyIO18ZLfOWV0uVnCZ2DnsOx7qDq8vsv2oySnd9HgM="}
