egresses roll back and report. This is the durable replacement for the stopgap. Verify with the controlled hang harness + unit tests.","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMhNzv5EMFKZfsjMEhka8qMeoCo8wWOSgAXJoBcj5Jd+lgVWP62/aGeW2MdUwq11wZ/YuzRrrwOUS4/2Pub0Ng0="}
