{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":957,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:11:38.859164481Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"246c7e5b-4bb4-404f-bfd3-d9eee60e0e3f","comment_uuid":"bdd00d83-598f-40cf-8511-242f23057fce","author":"OL2r","content":"SCOPE UPDATE from #192 (COMPLETE, verified): Phase 2 now includes — WIRE HEARTBEAT INTO OPENCODE'S HOOK SYSTEM. Evidence (#192 verification, issue #210): worktree hooks installed (.claude/hooks/heartbeat.py + crosslink_config.py) but heartbeat mtime does NOT flow — kickoff agents run 'opencode run', and .claude/settings.json PostToolUse hooks are Claude Code-only, so heartbeat.py never executes (no .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat in worktrees; main-repo heartbeat stale since 07-09). The #192 fold-in is necessary but NOT sufficient. REQUIRED: implement heartbeat via opencode's native mechanism — opencode.json hooks or a plugin (e.g. a PostToolUse-equivalent via tool.execute.after in a plugin, writing .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat throttled 120s). This is the PRIMARY liveness signal for the #135/#146 stalled-detection design; without it, the #146 kill/restart gates' heartbeat-primary criterion has no signal. Depends on: #192 (done). Related: #146 (Phase 3), #123 (timeout guidance).","created_at":"2026-08-06T05:11:38.846728544Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAMJT/zE+pWgUFxMz99p85pMOmpvndxg9kt6v4z0EdxTv6kl54rq40T5hZNJuAmwh0CwqtlVtaS3n033Gd4y6YBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLozlDtik7KxsRYeITIcTI0D4pOe8FAb85ASmg0UF7SbkQWvTqfmqp5PSgh3IUtuR5+JAH0EGWMnuU9tThpW/wU="}
