{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":1004,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T07:18:02.783157750Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"925fabf1-df8b-4b9f-9222-c6fa4600af79","title":"INFRA: crosslink kickoff cleanup --force is a broad sweep that kills live agents — violates the evidence-stream liveness principle (#192/#146)","description":"EVIDENCE (2026-08-06): a 'crosslink kickoff cleanup --force' run swept 23 agents including actively running ones — killed tmux sessions + removed worktrees, destroying uncommitted in-worktree state (commits + git branches + hub agent refs survive). Killed mid-flight: bJpy (#125 reviewer 3 mimo, verdict lost), oIft (#214 matrix, lost), uQTp (#201 inspect, lost); nHSI (#205/#209) survives via commit 792cdbe; BVCY relaunch never launched (tool timeout during kickoff init).\n\nWHY IT MATTERS: the #192/#146 reliability direction defines agent liveness by EVIDENCE STREAM (milestone checkpoints, heartbeat, file/commit activity), and the timer is explicitly a guide not a destroyer. cleanup --force is a second, unrelated destroyer that fires WITHOUT consulting any of those signals — it treats 'DONE-status worktree' as removable regardless of whether a live agent is mid-turn inside it. It also ran while hydration (#125) was actively mutating the issue store, compounding the renumbering/staleness churn.\n\nFIX DIRECTION (design task, not yet decided): (1) cleanup must classify 'has a live tmux/opencode session' as PROTECTED, never DONE-removable, regardless of stored status; (2) --force should require an explicit allowlist of agent IDs (targeted kill) rather than being a blanket sweep; (3) add a HALT-protocol-consistent guard: cleanup consults heartbeat/liveness before removing a worktree (same source of truth as #192/#146); (4) document the blast radius in the playbook §6.4 alongside the timer guidance. Related: #192 (timer not a destroyer), #146 (Phase 3 kill gates), #135 (watcher), #125 (hydration).","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCn6ESsdNDU5RSgKEGnTd6ilqA8ztZEfEACwmoTBtS1/Ci+aH8d6V0drOtMxsjH1tb3MOAAB2NbW1VmZ9BigbwE="}
