4 now cites hy3 C4/R4 (n=1 latency gap), not big-pickle R3; G8 now cites hy3 S6/R7 (version-expiry), not big-pickle systemic. big-pickle R3 (B2b) correctly maps to G2.\n\nVERIFY LINES EXTENDED — G3 Verify now also checks the §11 'dependency-free and patch-free' qualification and the re-validation-trigger note; G10 Verify now also records single host + stdio-only in the Limitations block.\n\nBUDGET — timer is a guide, not a kill (per #192 fix); 45m is not a hard ceiling. The execution builder may run to completion.\n\nPLAN STATUS: complete. Executing per this addendum.","created_at":"2026-08-08T06:04:32.839119238Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAIy2uQYO0ZpZYOCSWya6wtnvXB4XOVMdjmxDd+ihUJxJ6beHnNKIl56gTjWBqLl+IyAE0jHoAgaBesSzXLmc+Dg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQN7puqmbrecpFGMd7f/8RMzJq5GGWNK1uyL5STbQrg8Ga7j6l0UFjzYAN1Uo2HhOqVhuuR8Ktr1fsQKoScQwXw8="}
